# Allowed signers for contract tags (contract/<feature>/v<N>), in OpenSSH "allowed signers"
# format (`man ssh-keygen`, section ALLOWED SIGNERS). One key per line:
#
#   <principal> namespaces="git" <key-type> <base64-public-key> [comment]
#
# - <principal> names the signer: the owner's GitHub login (an email works too). git finds
#   it with `ssh-keygen -Y find-principals`, so it need not match the tagger's email.
# - namespaces="git" limits the key to git signatures.
#
# Trust: `cargo xtask contract-check` verifies contract tags only against the BASE branch's
# copy of this file, so a pull request can't approve its own contract by adding a key here.
# Only the owner edits this file (CODEOWNERS). Public keys only, never private keys.
nehmetohme namespaces="git" ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAINEr49hmLvWBtXD4ukvtsLFLQIzz6clu4NzlQfKQgPvX
